reagent-desc-dystopia-coal-tar = Black sticky tar from a coke oven. Smells of creosote and never washes off.
reagent-name-dystopia-sulfur-dioxide = sulfur dioxide
reagent-desc-dystopia-sulfur-dioxide = Liquefied sulfur dioxide from a roasting kiln. It tears at the throat and makes the eyes water. Sulfuric acid is made from it.
